simcase requires numpy, scipy, shapely and matplotlib, and its optional
``studio`` extra requires fastapi and uvicorn. They are installed separately
by the package installer under their own permissive licenses and are not
included in this distribution. Wheels of shapely load the GEOS library
(LGPL-2.1) as an unmodified shared library; simcase only calls shapely's
public Python API.

The optional test dependency ``galerkin-refsol`` is a separate FieldAlgo
package under Apache-2.0.
